  "query_preview": "..\n(Saturday through Tuesday)\nIssued at 129 AM CDT Wed Aug 26 2026\n\nThe warming trend then continues over the weekend as triple digit \nheat returns to the western half of the area Saturday and the \nremainder of the area Sunday. Sunday will likely see the return of \nheat headlines, after a couple of slightly cooler days, as afternoon \nheat indices once again top 105 across parts of the area. \n\nModels are still showing a transition of the upper ridge into the \nsoutheast part of the country as we go into next week. This will be \na gradual process through the early parts of next week. So outside \nof far northwest Oklahoma, which may see some low rain chances, the \nremainder of the area looks to remain dry with highs each day of 100-\n105.",
